# Public two-page Windows UIA heading/ancestry probe. Banner text and form
# semantics remain supplier-to-platform release gates. Keep the frame pump running during
# activation and observation; wait-file itself blocks it and is only a final
# check that the observer already completed its exact marker/ancestry proof.
settle 30
key escape
open ${SERVO_FIXTURE_BASE}/a11y.html?page=A
settle 80
act Open node in Workbench
settle 80
act Open Inspector pane
settle 10
click surface:inspector .radio @data-engine-id=graft.servo
settle 160
assert row Viewer: graft.servo
act Close pane
settle 10
act Open node in Workbench
settle 60
assert snap host-servo-views == 1
assert snap host-foreign-a11y-surfaces == 1
assert snap host-foreign-a11y-text ~ DOM-only A initial

open ${SERVO_FIXTURE_BASE}/a11y.html?page=B
settle 80
act Open node in Workbench
settle 80
act Open Inspector pane
settle 10
click surface:inspector .radio @data-engine-id=graft.servo
settle 160
assert row Viewer: graft.servo
act Close pane
settle 10
act Open node in Workbench
act Maximize pane
settle 60
assert wb-cells == 2
assert snap host-servo-views == 2
assert snap host-foreign-a11y-surfaces == 2
assert snap host-foreign-a11y-trees == 4
assert snap host-foreign-a11y-text ~ TOP A: red
assert snap host-foreign-a11y-text ~ TOP B: red
record-idle a11y-two-pages
settle 5400
wait-file 1 ${TURNSTONE_CAPTURE_DIR}/uia-ready.json
capture 01_windows_uia_two_pages
record-idle a11y-after-platform-observation
log Actual Windows UIA heading and ancestry observation acknowledged; body text, controls, human AT and other platforms remain open.
